<!-- Guiding Pillars for AI Data Foundation -->
<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-16">
  <div>
    <div class="kube-home-section-heading mb-10">
      <div>
        <span class="kube-kicker">Core Principles</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-1">
          What We Stand For
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 max-w-md">
        Five guiding principles directing every tutorial, benchmark evaluation, and catalog entry published by the foundation.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 shadow-xs hover:border-emerald-500/40 transition-all flex flex-col">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 mb-2">Pillar 01 &middot; Interoperability</span>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
          Open Protocols & Tooling
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          We champion standards like the Model Context Protocol (MCP) and open-source frameworks to ensure AI systems remain modular, interoperable, and free from proprietary vendor lock-in.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 shadow-xs hover:border-emerald-500/40 transition-all flex flex-col">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400 mb-2">Pillar 02 &middot; Transparency</span>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
          Reproducible Benchmarks
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Evaluation matters. We provide transparent scoring, hardware VRAM requirements, and quantization benchmarks so engineers make data-driven decisions when deploying models.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 shadow-xs hover:border-emerald-500/40 transition-all flex flex-col">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 mb-2">Pillar 03 &middot; Practice</span>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
          Hands-on, Self-Paced Labs
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Real understanding comes from building. Our labs walk through concrete implementations: setting up local vector stores, chaining LLM agents, and measuring data quality.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 shadow-xs hover:border-emerald-500/40 transition-all flex flex-col">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 mb-2">Pillar 04 &middot; Security</span>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
          AI Safety &amp; Data Protection
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Security is foundational. We prioritize prompt injection defense, model watermarking, automated red-teaming, data provenance, and regulatory compliance in every tool, lab, and benchmark we publish.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 shadow-xs hover:border-emerald-500/40 transition-all flex flex-col">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 mb-2">Pillar 05 &middot; Open Core</span>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
          Community &amp; Open Governance
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          All foundation assets, markdown documentation, tool directories, and static files are released under the Apache 2.0 license and managed openly on GitHub.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

